{"seq":3,"slug":"retry-fallback","title":"重试与降级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/error-handling-exception-design/patterns/retry-fallback","wordCount":1891,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"重试与降级\">重试与降级</h1><p>一个支付服务在双十一峰值时，下游风控接口偶尔返回超时。最朴素的反应是「失败了就立刻再试一次」——结果是：成千上万个请求在风控接口刚抖动的那一刻同时重试，把一个本会自愈的小抖动，放大成一场把风控接口彻底打死的「重试风暴」。这一篇讲当 <a href=\"../foundations/failure-taxonomy\">故障分类</a> 判定一个失败「可恢复」时，如何用退避重试、降级和熔断把它真正消化掉——以及为什么每一种手段都自带一把必须握紧的安全锁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可恢复故障的应对是一个分层的「韧性栈」：最内层是重试（同样的操作再试），中间是熔断（连续失败时干脆别试了），最外层是降级（主路径不通时走次优路径）。它们层层兜底，把一个可能上抛给用户的错误，尽量在系统内部消化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[操作失败] --&gt; B{是暂时性故障吗?&lt;br/&gt;errors.As 判断}&#10;    B --&gt;|否-永久性/缺陷| Z[不重试, 直接上报]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C{熔断器是否打开?}&#10;    C --&gt;|打开| D[跳过调用, 直接走降级]&#10;    C --&gt;|闭合| E{操作幂等?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| Z2[不可盲目重试&lt;br/&gt;需幂等键]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[退避+抖动后重试]&#10;    F --&gt; G{重试预算用尽?}&#10;    G --&gt;|否, 成功| H[返回结果]&#10;    G --&gt;|是, 仍失败| I[降级: 缓存/默认值/兜底]&#10;    D --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n    A[操作失败] --&gt; B{是暂时性故障吗?&lt;br/&gt;errors.As 判断}\n    B --&gt;|否-永久性/缺陷| Z[不重试, 直接上报]\n    B --&gt;|是| C{熔断器是否打开?}\n    C --&gt;|打开| D[跳过调用, 直接走降级]\n    C --&gt;|闭合| E{操作幂等?}\n    E --&gt;|否| Z2[不可盲目重试&lt;br/&gt;需幂等键]\n    E --&gt;|是| F[退避+抖动后重试]\n    F --&gt; G{重试预算用尽?}\n    G --&gt;|否, 成功| H[返回结果]\n    G --&gt;|是, 仍失败| I[降级: 缓存/默认值/兜底]\n    D --&gt; I</pre><p>三种手段各自针对不同情形，下表对照它们的触发条件与必备安全锁。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>何时用</th>\n<th>解决什么</th>\n<th>必备安全锁</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重试</td>\n<td>暂时性故障（超时、429、死锁）</td>\n<td>熬过短暂抖动</td>\n<td>幂等性 + 退避 + 抖动 + 预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>熔断</td>\n<td>下游持续不可用</td>\n<td>阻止重试风暴、给下游喘息</td>\n<td>阈值 + 半开探测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降级</td>\n<td>主路径不可用且有替代</td>\n<td>保住核心功能</td>\n<td>替代值的正确性与时效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"重试-暂时性故障的解药-附带四把锁\">重试：暂时性故障的解药，附带四把锁</h2><p>重试只对<strong>暂时性故障</strong>有意义——那些「再试一次大概率就好」的失败：网络超时、限流 429、数据库死锁回滚、下游 503。对永久性故障（404、400 参数错误、认证失败）重试纯属浪费，对缺陷类失败重试更是荒谬。判断「这是不是暂时性故障」依赖上一篇讲的沿链判断（<code>errors.As</code> 取出错误类型看它是不是 timeout），详见 <a href=\"error-propagation\">错误传播与包装</a>。</p>\n<p>确认可重试后，四把安全锁缺一不可：</p>\n<p><strong>第一把：幂等性。</strong> 重试意味着同一操作可能执行多次，只有幂等操作（执行 N 次效果同执行 1 次）才能安全重试。「查询」天然幂等；「扣款」「下单」不幂等，必须配合幂等键（idempotency key）让服务端识别并去重重复请求，否则一次重试就是一次重复扣款。这把锁是 <a href=\"../foundations/failure-taxonomy\">故障分类</a> 里「重试以幂等为前提」那句话的展开。</p>\n<p><strong>第二把：指数退避。</strong> 不要等间隔重试，而是每次等待时间指数增长。设基础延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试（从 0 计），退避延迟为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_n = \\min(d_{\\max},\\; d_0 \\cdot 2^{n})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>封顶 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 防止延迟无限增长。这给下游越来越长的恢复时间。</p>\n<p><strong>第三把：抖动（jitter）。</strong> 纯指数退避有个致命问题：所有客户端在同一时刻失败，就会在同一时刻重试，形成同步的重试浪涌。加入随机抖动打散它。AWS 推荐的「全抖动」公式是在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, d_n]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 区间均匀取随机值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>delay</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>random</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{delay} = \\text{random}(0,\\; \\min(d_{\\max},\\; d_0 \\cdot 2^{n}))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">delay</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">random</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>抖动是把「重试风暴」化解成「平滑重试流」的关键，2025 年的主流客户端库（含各大云 SDK）几乎都默认内置退避加抖动。</p>\n<p><strong>第四把：重试预算。</strong> 重试次数必须有上限，且整个系统的重试流量应有总预算（retry budget），防止重试本身吃掉所有容量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def call_with_retry(fn, max_attempts=4, base=0.1, cap=10.0):&#10;    for n in range(max_attempts):&#10;        try:&#10;            return fn()&#10;        except TransientError as e:&#10;            if n == max_attempts - 1:&#10;                raise            # 预算用尽, 上报&#10;            delay = random.uniform(0, min(cap, base * (2 ** n)))  # 退避+全抖动&#10;            time.sleep(delay)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> call_with_retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fn, max_attempts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, base</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(max_attempts):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fn()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        except</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TransientError </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_attempts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                raise</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 预算用尽, 上报</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            delay </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> random.uniform(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cap, base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> **</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n)))  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 退避+全抖动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            time.sleep(delay)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"熔断-连续失败时停止徒劳\">熔断：连续失败时停止徒劳</h2><p>当下游不是「抖动」而是「真的挂了」，继续重试只会雪上加霜——既浪费自己的资源，又给濒死的下游持续施压。熔断器（circuit breaker）就是为此而生：它统计最近的失败率，一旦超过阈值就「跳闸」，在一段时间内<strong>直接拒绝调用、不再尝试</strong>，让下游有机会恢复。</p>\n<p>熔断器有三个状态：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>闭合（closed）</strong>：正常放行，统计失败。</li>\n<li><strong>打开（open）</strong>：失败率超阈值，跳闸；所有调用立即失败（或直接走降级），不碰下游。</li>\n<li><strong>半开（half-open）</strong>：跳闸一段时间后，放少量探测请求试水；成功则回到闭合，失败则继续打开。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>熔断的数学直觉正是 <a href=\"../foundations/failure-taxonomy\">故障分类</a> 里那条判据：当单次重试成功概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 趋近 0，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-p)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不再随重试次数下降，重试就从「可恢复手段」退化成「徒劳消耗」，此时熔断接管，把「可恢复」的判断从乐观切换到现实。熔断 + 重试预算 + 幂等键，是 2025 年下游韧性设计的三件套。</p>\n<h2 id=\"降级-保住核心-牺牲非核心\">降级：保住核心，牺牲非核心</h2><p>当重试无望、熔断打开，最后一道防线是降级（graceful degradation）：主路径走不通，就退到一条「不完美但可用」的次优路径。降级的层次从优到劣：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>缓存兜底</strong>：返回上一次成功的缓存结果（汇率、配置）。</li>\n<li><strong>默认值 / 静态兜底</strong>：返回一个安全的默认值（推荐服务挂了返回静态热门榜）。</li>\n<li><strong>功能裁剪</strong>：关闭非核心功能，保住核心链路（评论加载失败不影响商品下单）。</li>\n<li><strong>优雅报错</strong>：实在无法降级，就返回一个清晰、可重试的错误给用户，而不是崩溃或挂起。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>降级的安全锁是<strong>替代值的正确性与时效</strong>：一个过期太久的缓存汇率可能比报错更危险。降级决策往往需要业务来定「什么可以牺牲、什么绝不能错」。降级时返回给用户的错误如何设计才清晰且可重试，详见 <a href=\"../practices/api-error-design\">API 错误设计与错误码</a>；每一次重试、熔断、降级都应被记录以便观测系统健康，详见 <a href=\"../practices/logging-errors\">错误日志与可观测性</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合-让韧性栈协同工作\">组合：让韧性栈协同工作</h2><p>三种手段单独用都不够，威力在组合。一个成熟的下游调用通常这样编排：先判断是否暂时性故障（否则不重试）→ 检查熔断器（打开则直接降级）→ 闭合则带退避抖动重试若干次 → 仍失败则触发降级 → 全程记录指标喂给熔断器和监控。</p>\n<p>这条编排链有一个容易被忽视的全局视角：<strong>重试会放大流量</strong>。如果调用链有三层，每层各重试 3 次，最底层在故障时会承受 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3^3 = 27</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span></span></span></span></span> 倍的请求放大。所以重试通常<strong>只应在一个层级做</strong>（一般是最接近故障源、最了解幂等性的那层），而不是每层都重试——这是大规模系统里反复踩坑后的铁律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可恢复故障的应对是分层韧性栈：重试（熬过抖动）→ 熔断（停止徒劳）→ 降级（保住核心）。</li>\n<li><strong>重试</strong>只对暂时性故障有效（靠 <code>errors.As</code> 判断），必须握紧四把锁：幂等性、指数退避、抖动、重试预算。</li>\n<li>退避用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_n=\\min(d_{\\max}, d_0\\cdot 2^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，抖动用全抖动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>random</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{random}(0, d_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">random</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 化解同步重试风暴；2025 主流 SDK 默认内置。</li>\n<li><strong>熔断器</strong>三态（闭合/打开/半开）在下游真正不可用时跳闸，对应「成功概率趋零则停止重试」的数学判据。</li>\n<li><strong>降级</strong>按缓存→默认值→功能裁剪→优雅报错分层兜底，安全锁是替代值的正确性与时效。</li>\n<li>重试会逐层放大流量（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mtext>层数</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k^{\\text{层数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">层数</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），所以只在单一层级重试；全程记录指标喂给熔断与监控。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"重试与降级","id":"重试与降级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"重试：暂时性故障的解药，附带四把锁","id":"重试-暂时性故障的解药-附带四把锁"},{"level":2,"text":"熔断：连续失败时停止徒劳","id":"熔断-连续失败时停止徒劳"},{"level":2,"text":"降级：保住核心，牺牲非核心","id":"降级-保住核心-牺牲非核心"},{"level":2,"text":"组合：让韧性栈协同工作","id":"组合-让韧性栈协同工作"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"错误上下文与诊断信息","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/error-handling-exception-design/patterns/error-context"},"next":{"title":"API 错误设计与错误码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/error-handling-exception-design/practices/api-error-design"}}